{
  "key": 19951,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_SaffronCity_House_Text_Pidgey",
      "en_US": "Pidgey: Kurukkoo!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_SaffronCity_House_Text_DontLookAtMyLetter",
      "en_US": [
        "…Thank you for writing.\n",
        "I hope to see you soon!\r",
        "…Hey!\n",
        "Don’t look at my letter!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_SaffronCity_House_Text_GettingCopycatPokeDoll",
      "en_US": [
        "The Copycat is cute!\n",
        "I’m getting her a Poké Doll."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_TrainingHouse_Text_CelesteIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Saffron trainers are the best\n",
        "in Kanto. Shall I prove it?\r",
        "Want to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_TrainingHouse_Text_After",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back any time you want\n",
        "to battle again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_TrainingHouse_Text_GenevieveIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "My sister and I take turns\n",
        "training visitors.\r",
        "Want to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_PaintWorld_Text_FigureFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "A figure made of paint turns to\n",
        "face you. It raises a brush."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_SaffronCity_House_Text_ExplainPPUp",
      "en_US": [
        "I was given a PP Up as a gift.\r",
        "It’s used to increase the PP of\n",
        "a Pokémon’s move.\r",
        "I should use it on a powerful move\n",
        "with only a few PP."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_TrainingHouse_Text_Declined",
      "en_US": "Whenever you’re ready, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_PaintWorld_Text_FigureSketch",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure’s colors swirl.\n",
        "It’s waiting for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_PaintWorld_Text_FigureMega",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure is holding a stone that\n",
        "shines in every color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_PaintWorld_Text_Dissolve",
      "en_US": [
        "The figure runs like wet paint…\n",
        "The world around it does too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0964_CV_CANVAS_SAFFRON_HOUSE_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
